    "completion": "Follow the confirmation screen to finish adding the app.",
    "text": "# Add to Home Screen from Brave\n\nStart in Brave. Step 3 opens the same website in Safari; steps 4–7 take place in Safari.\n\n1. **Tap *Share*.** In Brave, tap Share in the bottom toolbar. Its icon is a square with an upward arrow. If the toolbar is hidden, tap the website address to reveal it.\n2. **Tap *View More*.** If the share sheet is collapsed, tap View More, shown with a downward chevron, to reveal the remaining actions. If the action list is already visible, continue to step 3.\n3. ***Open in Safari*.** In the expanded share sheet, scroll down and tap Open in Safari. The website opens in Safari; perform all remaining steps there.\n4. **Open the *Page Menu*.** Tap the Page Menu button on the left side of the website address bar. Its icon has three horizontal lines, with a shorter bottom line.\n5. **Tap *Share*.** In the Page Menu, tap Share. Its icon is a square with an arrow pointing upward.\n6. **Tap *View More*.** If the share sheet is collapsed, tap View More, shown with a downward chevron, to reveal the remaining actions. If the action list is already visible, continue to step 7.\n7. **Tap *Add to Home Screen*.** In the expanded action list, find and tap Add to Home Screen. Its icon is a rounded square containing a plus sign.\n"
