    "text": "# Add to Home Screen from Chrome\n\nUse Chrome on your iPhone. These steps install directly from its share sheet.\n\n1. **Tap *Share*.** In Chrome, tap Share at the right end of the address bar at the top of the screen. Its icon is a square with an upward arrow.\n2. **Tap *View More*.** If the share sheet is collapsed, tap View More, shown with a downward chevron, to reveal the remaining actions. If the action list is already visible, continue to step 3.\n3. **Tap *Add to Home Screen*.** In the expanded action list, find and tap Add to Home Screen. Its icon is a rounded square containing a plus sign.\n"
